  (text "RADAR SENSOR" (at 16.51 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 02ff6f27-4d9e-4728-b3fe-1aeb34061bda)
  )
  (text "<- SDO is I2C address bit 0" (at 100.33 150.495 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1aee064f-9b66-414c-a7d5-7bc9fcf063f9)
  )
  (text "4-in-1 VOC Humidity Pressure Temperature" (at 16.51 113.665 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1f8537cc-cb27-467b-988e-c8bc6db9c490)
  )
  (text "ALS - Ambient Light Sensor" (at 137.795 104.775 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 20041546-b29a-41ac-9380-66878eb4ff9c)
  )
  (text "CSB -> VDDIO = I2C active\nCSB -> GND = SPI active\nI2C ADDR = BIN 1110111 HEX 0x77\nI2C pull-up resistors are on the ESP32 sheet."
    (at 15.24 182.245 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3b1620cc-3035-4fc6-ba49-e2f378a9b539)
  )
  (text "range = 0.01lux - 64K lux\nI2C ADDR = 0x29 (7bit)" (at 140.335 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 58d8b870-d963-4df5-ac9d-0d761be546bd)
  )
  (text "INT_ALS is not really needed,\nhandled at higher level by meshbots\nwe just read sensor continously."
    (at 199.39 147.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6939aa8f-17df-40b9-a844-d335cb1671b9)
  )
  (text "BSEC: Bosch Sensortec Environmental Cluster\nBSEC precisely performs several calculations outside the device such as ambient air temperature,\nambient relative humidity, pressure and air quality (IAQ) level.\nhttps://www.bosch-sensortec.com/software-tools/software/bsec/\nhttps://github.com/BoschSensortec/BSEC-Arduino-library"
    (at 15.24 193.675 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8d45f0fa-df11-4fc8-827a-c2d4f3d2423a)
  )
  (text "Radar sensor sits externally on it's own PCB\nand is connected via FPC to the maimboard."
    (at 46.99 78.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid bb94204a-a1c2-468a-8193-55c247f4469c)
  )
  (text "PMS5003 PM2.5 Sensor" (at 139.7 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d1192c48-6c78-4143-a5b9-985f11d8f09c)
  )
  (text "PMS5003 logic is 3V3, but the internal fan runs at 5V.\nMatching female connector is Molex 053261-0871 PicoBlade."
    (at 149.86 78.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fbbb8d7a-bb86-4902-83e0-fe3194503f85)
  )

